<h2 style="text-align: center;">WCNC Magical Toy Drive</h2>
<p style="text-align: center;">Each year The Salvation Army partners with WCNC (NBC Charlotte) to collect toys for children of families experiencing poverty and hardship. We've made it easy, and safe, for you to help by donating funds for the purchase of new toys.</p>
